<section class="orbitra-story" id="how-it-works">

  <div class="orbitra-container">

    <div class="orbitra-story__intro">

      <p class="orbitra-eyebrow" data-reveal>MEET ORBITRA</p>

 

      <h2 class="orbitra-section-title" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1">

        Not just something you watch.

        <span>Something you control.</span>

      </h2>

 

      <p class="orbitra-subtitle orbitra-story__lead" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2">

        Start the rotor, give Orbitra a controlled toss, and experiment with angle and direction

        to create different flight paths.

      </p>

    </div>

 

    <div class="orbitra-story__visual orbitra-glass" data-reveal>

      <img

        src="{{ 'orb-2.jpg' | asset_url }}"

        alt="Orbitra LED flying orb glowing in blue and violet light"

        loading="lazy"

      >

      <div class="orbitra-story__visual-shade"></div>

      <p class="orbitra-story__visual-label">LIGHT IN MOTION</p>

    </div>

 

    <div class="orbitra-steps">

      <article class="orbitra-step" data-reveal>

        <span class="orbitra-step__number">01</span>

        <h3>Power it on.</h3>

        <p>Switch on Orbitra, hold the center axis, and spin the wheel to start the rotor.</p>

      </article>

 

      <article class="orbitra-step" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1">

        <span class="orbitra-step__number">02</span>

        <h3>Give it a toss.</h3>

        <p>Use a controlled throw and change the angle to explore different flight paths.</p>

      </article>

 

      <article class="orbitra-step" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2">

        <span class="orbitra-step__number">03</span>

        <h3>Guide the flight.</h3>

        <p>Experiment with direction, distance, and timing while the LEDs light up the motion.</p>

      </article>

 

      <article class="orbitra-step" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="3">

        <span class="orbitra-step__number">04</span>

        <h3>Catch. Repeat.</h3>

        <p>Catch Orbitra, reset your throw, and try a new route, trick, or return path.</p>

      </article>

    </div>

 

    <div class="orbitra-spec-strip orbitra-glass" data-reveal>

      <div>

        <strong>6–8 MIN</strong>

        <span>Typical flight time</span>

      </div>

      <div>

        <strong>30–35 MIN</strong>

        <span>Charging time</span>

      </div>

      <div>

        <strong>9.5 × 9.5 CM</strong>

        <span>Compact size</span>

      </div>

      <div>

        <strong>USB</strong>

        <span>Rechargeable</span>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>

 

